4. **Auto-deactivation**: Apply view, then call filterActions.setPriority (simulating user change) → verify activeViewId becomes null and URL param removed
5. **skipDeactivationRef prevents self-deactivation**: Apply view → verify deactivation does NOT fire on the same render cycle
