## Summary

This task creates a Playwright E2E spec (agents-sidebar.spec.ts) that exercises the agent-related features visible in the production sidebar. The component hierarchy is: App → WorkspaceLayout (AgentProvider) → WorkspaceTree → AgentCard / WorkQueueSection / SidebarStatusBar. Agent data flows from three loom daemon endpoints via useAgentContext (polling /api/loom/api/agents, /api/loom/api/status, /api/loom/api/tasks), while workspace structure comes from /api/workspaces/active via useWorkspaceRepos. The test mocks all these endpoints, then verifies rendering, interaction, and edge-case behavior through Playwright selectors.

**IMPORTANT architecture note**: The standalone AgentsSidebar component (src/components/AgentsSidebar/) is **not mounted** in the production app. The app uses WorkspaceTree as its sidebar (App.tsx line 898), which includes agent display via AgentCard, WorkQueueSection, and SidebarStatusBar. This E2E spec targets the agent sidebar features as rendered through WorkspaceTree.

